#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11208
msgid "Build pages visually while Minn protects Breakdance-owned content and links straight to its builder. Download the plugin .zip from Breakdance."
msgstr "Byg sider visuelt, mens Minn beskytter Breakdance-ejet indhold og linker direkte til dets builder. Download plugin'et .zip fra Breakdance."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11220
msgid "Build forms and manage their entries, notifications, feeds, and daily settings in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from your Gravity account."
msgstr "Byg formularer og administrer deres indtastninger, notifikationer, feeds og daglige indstillinger i Minn. Download plugin'et .zip fra din Gravity-konto."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11232
msgid "Send and track WordPress email through the full Email surface in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from a qualifying Gravity account."
msgstr "Send og spor WordPress-e-mail gennem hele e-mail-overfladen i Minn. Download plugin'et .zip fra en kvalificerende Gravity-konto."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11244
msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Administrer Perfmatters-indstillingerne fra Minn's Performance-overflade. Download det betalte plugin .zip fra Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11256
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Bring ACF PRO-repeatere, fleksibelt indhold, gallerier, indstillingssider, blokke og feltgrupper til Minn. Download plugin'et .zip fra ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11268
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Administrer Elementor-formularindsendelser i Minn, mens du holder Elementor-ejet sideindhold beskyttet. Download plugin'et .zip fra Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11280
msgid "Manage WPForms Pro entries, read and starred state, spam, trash, search, and form filters in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from WPForms."
msgstr "Administrer WPForms Pro-poster, læst og stjernemarkeret tilstand, spam, papirkurv, søge- og formularfiltre i Minn. Download plugin'et .zip fra WPForms."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11292
msgid "Clear WP Rocket caches from Minn and monitor its license alongside other paid components. Download the plugin .zip from WP Rocket."
msgstr "Ryd WP Rocket-cacher fra Minn og overvåg dens licens sammen med andre betalte komponenter. Download plugin'et .zip fra WP Rocket."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11304
msgid "Feed AnalyticsWP traffic and drill-down data into Minn's Overview. Download the paid plugin .zip from AnalyticsWP."
msgstr "Før AnalyticsWP-trafik og detaljerede data ind i Minns oversigt. Download det betalte plugin .zip fra AnalyticsWP."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11316
msgid "Sell recurring products and services with WooCommerce. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
msgstr "Sælg tilbagevendende produkter og tjenester med WooCommerce. Denne betalte udvidelse installeres ved at uploade .zip downloadet fra WooCommerce.com."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11328
msgid "Sell memberships that unlock restricted content, products and discounts. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
msgstr "Sælg medlemskaber, der låser op for begrænset indhold, produkter og rabatter. Denne betalte udvidelse installeres ved at uploade den .zip, der er downloadet fra WooCommerce.com."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:11340
msgid "Generate a full WordPress backup (files + database) and pull it off-site with the Disembark CLI or disembark.host."
msgstr "Generer en fuld WordPress-sikkerhedskopi (filer + database), og hent den væk fra webstedet med Disembark CLI eller disembark.host."

